    "content": "Input\n* Please include the variable type in each description and revise the section as follows:\n\n<<Line 1>>: A string [[mode]], representing the game mode, which is either {{high}} or {{low}}.\n<<Line 2>>: An integer [[n]] for the number of players.\n<<Next [[n]] lines>>: Two space-separated strings [[name]] and [[hand]], representing a player's name and the letter tiles in their hand.\n<<Next line>>: An integer [[d]] for the number of words in the dictionary.\n<<Next [[d]] lines>>: A string [[word]] for a word in the dictionary.\n\nOutput\n* Please rewrite this section as follows:\n\n<<1 or more lines>>: The winners' names and their winning words, separated by a space, with one winner per line.\n\nConstraints\n* Please replace \"each hand/word\" with \"[[name]], [[hand]], [[word]]\".\n\n* Please remove the constraint on mode.\n\n* Please replace the final two constraints with these two:\n\n[[name]]s and [[word]]s are unique in each case.\n[[name]], [[hand]] and [[word]] consist of lowercase English letters only.\n\n* The upper bounds may be revised later, subject to further review.\n\nStub generator\n* Please add a write statement, e.g. write answer, or write winner word.\n\nDifficulty\n* Please set the difficulty to Easy.\n\nCover picture\n* Please add a cover picture for the puzzle.\n\nCases\n* To be reviewed.\n\nThanks.",
